WEBVTT

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:22.000
Subtitles brought to you by the Starry Love team 🌟 @ Viki

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:42.880
[Love like the galaxy 2]

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:46.660
[Episode 26]

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:02.990
Sister Shaoshang, that day my words were harsh.

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:06.660
I bragged about General Huo's affection for me.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.620
I ask my sister to forgive me.

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:13.880
After my husband died, the people of the Luo family continued to force me.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:18.100
They hoped I would get married and move up socially soon.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:22.350
Otherwise, they will marry me again in the Northwest.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:27.160
A woman like me who has nothing but my name, can be up to the task for my first marriage,

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:31.260
but there aren't many choices left for my second wedding.

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:35.840
So I was impatient.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:41.290
So you clung to General Huo and wouldn't let him go.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.620
I have had feelings for General Huo since I was young.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:48.500
I hoped I could be with him.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.280
It's a shame he doesn't think so.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:17.690
The worst thing I've done

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:20.200
was to overestimate myself

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:24.300
and underestimating General Huo's affection for you.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:28.420
I deserved public humiliation this time too.

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.830
General Huo, in front of so many people,

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:36.060
sent a mirror to my father and specified that it was for my dowry.

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:38.100
I dare not imagine

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.420
how humiliated my father was at that moment.

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:51.510
Don't look at me.

00:03:52.260 --> 00:03:54.040
I don't want anything to do with him.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:56.870
I will plead even less on your behalf with him.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:04:02.110
I won't persuade him to marry you either. That's your own business.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.400
Non.

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:11.070
A passing passion poorly invested for five years,

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.850
That's already enough.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:18.310
How many five years can a woman have in her life?

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:21.950
Today I came to tell Sister Shaoshang

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:26.640
that I decided to return to the Northwest to live the rest of my days.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:30.780
We will say goodbye in this life.

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:34.440
I've already found a carriage.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.620
I will leave tonight.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:40.660
My sister and General Huo must grow old together.

00:04:40.660 --> 00:04:44.470
Otherwise, I will not accept it even if I am in the Northwest.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:03.790
I've already given up my obsession with Huo Buyi now.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:07.880
But I still have something to do

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:10.440
for Empress Xuan.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:20.380
After Empress Xuan fell seriously ill,

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:24.110
General Huo still missed him in his heart.

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:27.920
Now General Huo has finally returned.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:34.060
What about the Empress's illness now?

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:38.010
Imperial Physician Sun says his depression is deep.

00:05:38.010 --> 00:05:40.200
Heart disease is difficult to treat. (Note: A mental illness)

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:43.550
This morning his illness worsened again.

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:46.280
She can't even get up anymore.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.850
I understand.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.030
Empress.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:31.610
Is this Zisheng?

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.720
It's me.

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.120
You have lost weight.

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:07.760
I am worried about the capital.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:09.790
I don't dare to relax.

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:15.020
Are you worried about the capital or...

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.780
Worried about Shaoshang?

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:25.500
There is something I want to tell you.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:29.830
Yuan Shanjian and Shaoshang

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.340
are not engaged.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.070
I know.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:52.420
You are still in Shaoshang's heart.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:57.030
I know that too.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.240
I was wrong.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.230
I have already decided...

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.780
to spend my whole life atoning for my sins.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:30.550
When she needed love most in her youth,

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:33.320
she didn't receive any from her family.

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:38.600
If you want to love him,

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:42.830
so you must make amends for the regrets his heart has.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:47.400
Don't always ask him to understand your choices.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.240
You can both take the trip together

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:53.710
only if you talk about things.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.500
Yes.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.690
In the future, Shaoshang and I...

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:05.380
we will say everything and speak without reserve.

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:09.290
There will be no secrets.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:16.530
It's a pity that time is too short.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:23.320
I'm afraid I can't see you get married.

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:34.910
I, your child, am incompetent. (Note: He calls himself her child because he grew up in her palace)

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.890
I made you worry.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:10:00.020
I just hope that in the next life,

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:05.440
you two can be my biological son and daughter.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:09.180
I also hope that I can live a few more years

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:11.720
to smile all year round...

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:15.030
to have you both to take care of me until my old age.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:19.170
This kind of life...

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:21.850
can be considered fulfilled.

00:10:55.570 --> 00:11:00.990
Miss Luo, why haven't we reached the residence of the miracle doctor you mentioned?

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.410
Previously, I looked for medicine for the Seventh Young Master.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:07.400
So I asked my family and friends to find the residencies of a bunch of highly qualified doctors in the capital.

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.530
In the end, I chose this person.

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:13.330
This doctor is really good at treating people with depression.

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:18.340
If Miss Cheng doesn't believe me, please return to Changqiu Palace.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:22.970
I'm afraid Empress Xuan won't be able to bear it any longer.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:30.520
Then stop the carriage first. I'll disturb Miss Luo.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:34.730
so that she can tell me the exact location. After I return and report it to Her Majesty

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:36.940
I will bring sumptuous gifts during my visit.

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:41.050
Sister Shaoshang, you don't trust me?

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:47.930
Look. This carriage contains all my things.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:53.040
I came to the capital with them. Now I'm leaving with nothing else.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:55.330
I decided to go back to the Northwest.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:59.820
Before I go, why should I hurt you?

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.880
Non-commissioned Officer Liang Qiufei passed on a message.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:15.860
He asks General Huo to leave the palace to attend to an urgent matter.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.030
Vas-y.

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:27.590
When you see Shaoshang, speak to him kindly.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:32.270
She will understand you.

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:40.570
I will do it.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:54.230
General Huo, Non-Commissioned Officer Liang Qiufei said that

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:56.790
Miss Cheng had left in Miss Luo's carriage

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.820
and that they had left the capital for the outskirts of the city.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.100
When was it?

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:02.280
About an hour ago.

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:14.480
When you return to the Northwest, you will be able to choose a future spouse in peace.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.590
If someone is right for you, you won't have to reluctantly settle down for the rest of your life.

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:21.920
Who said that if a young woman didn't have a husband, she couldn't live?

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.130
Younger sister really has no idea.

00:13:24.130 --> 00:13:28.860
Apart from General Huo, I will never marry anyone else.

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:33.550
He is not the only man in the world.

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:36.440
Why should you cling to a single tree until you die?

00:13:37.840 --> 00:13:39.280
You don't understand.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:42.100
Since I was young, I have been attracted to General Huo.

00:13:42.100 --> 00:13:45.870
But because of my modest status, I naturally did not dare to confess my feelings.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.240
Later, we were each engaged on our own.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.500
I thought there was no hope for this life.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.710
Who would have known that Heaven decided to have mercy on me

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.080
and allowed me to find General Huo in the Northwest?

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:59.040
Younger Sister Shaoshang couldn't imagine how delighted I was at that moment.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:03.510
It was like throwing a lifeline to someone about to drown.

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:09.850
So when you and your late husband were still married,

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:11.920
Were you already thinking about General Huo?

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:17.100
Do you know what it feels like to love someone deeply?

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:20.100
but that we must serve someone else with body and mind?

00:14:20.100 --> 00:14:23.500
In bed, there wasn't a single moment when I wasn't thinking about him.

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:27.690
I even had to imagine Zisheng in Seventh Master Jia's place in order to bear it.

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:29.370
I didn't know.

00:14:29.370 --> 00:14:31.230
You don't need to tell me such ridiculous things.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:32.930
That's because you're clearly heartless.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:36.400
Do you know what kind of life he led in the Northwest?

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:39.280
He charged the enemy lines and fought with his life.

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:41.990
Every time he fought a battle, others sought survival while he sought death.

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.780
You have such a cruel heart.

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:46.490
Why are you so ruthless with him?

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:53.390
Luckily, Zisheng has me.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.980
I love him and respect him.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:15:00.070
No matter what he does to me, I don't blame him.

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:04.570
I can accept its good and bad sides.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:10.210
I'm different from a young lady like you who gets engaged and calls it off on a whim.

00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:13.780
I lived a chaste life. And I only loved one person.

00:15:13.780 --> 00:15:17.760
Miss Luo, if it weren't for Empress Xuan,

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:20.580
I would never have come here with you.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.610
Stop the carriage.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:26.280
Cheng Shaoshang! Because of you, Huo Buyi cut all ties with me.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.280
Now that I have nowhere to go,

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.180
all the young ladies of the capital are waiting to make fun of me.

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:34.140
How could I let you get out of the carriage?

00:15:34.140 --> 00:15:37.160
Let go of me. Let go of me!

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:39.660
Did you know that

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:43.410
The military doctors said that the bite scar on Zisheng's arm would never heal?

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:47.010
He even used medication to make his scar deeper. All because of you!

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:49.110
I was so bitterly deceived by you both.

00:15:49.110 --> 00:15:51.790
You fooled yourself!

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.730
Let go of me!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.500
He remains indifferent to all the other young ladies.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:00.640
Why are you so special?

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.500
I entered the palace before you.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.160
I am more intelligent and virtuous than you.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:08.070
How come Huo Buyi only has eyes for you?

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:10.060
You really deserve to die.

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:15.180
Luo Jitong, even if you kill me, you won't get it.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.260
So what?

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:20.850
For him, I'm ready to do anything!

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:23.370
I didn't even hesitate to kill my husband.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.990
But he still doesn't love me.

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:27.930
As long as I kill you,

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:33.280
He will remember me forever. Even if he hates me with all his heart.

00:17:11.690 --> 00:17:13.420
Stop the carriage!

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.290
Shaoshang!

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:22.210
Stop the carriage!

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:23.620
Zisheng!

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:26.550
If you dare stop the carriage, I'll kill it on the spot!

00:17:26.550 --> 00:17:28.870
Luo Jitong, la chez-la !

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:30.150
We can talk about everything else properly!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:32.290
Talk ?

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.150
I begged you yesterday, yet your expression hasn't changed one iota.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.950
But now you're afraid?

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:39.280
Well, if you want me to let her go, I can do that.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:42.840
But you have to marry me. Can you accept that?

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:48.620
Let her go first. I'll accept anything!

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:51.540
Stop lying to me! You think I don't know?

00:17:51.540 --> 00:17:55.520
that apart from Cheng Shaoshang, you have no intention of marrying anyone else? Since that's the case,

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.490
What's the point of continuing to live?

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:00.350
I'm going to die with her!

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:18.270
Shaoshang, tiens bon!

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:24.660
Hurry up and let go of me! With your skills, you should be able to climb.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:28.150
If you don't let go of me now, we'll both die here.

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:36.270
Let go of me!

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:45.230
I won't let go unless I'm dead.

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:00.090
Huo Buyi.

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.940
Even if you die for me, I will not forgive you.

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:08.810
- Hurry up and let go of me! - I won't live without you!

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:19.950
I know. I've done too many bad things.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:22.370
and I don't deserve your forgiveness.

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:26.330
But since we bit each other's arm like a bond,

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.130
I have already taken you as my wife.

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:36.970
So if you live, I live.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.420
If you die,

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.820
I'm dying!

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:09.510
Young Lord, we are here!

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.510
Hold fast !

00:21:11.510 --> 00:21:13.790
Shaoshang, hold on to the rope!

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.160
Your injury...

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:33.550
How are you.

00:21:34.400 --> 00:21:37.110
Everything will be fine once the doctors have bandaged her.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:41.490
Mademoiselle Cheng,

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:46.680
Let me walk you back to the palace.

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.830
It is not necessary.

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:52.050
I can leave on my own.

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:58.890
So let A'Qi take you back.

00:21:59.640 --> 00:22:01.990
Take my carriage.

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:03.750
Is...

00:22:10.860 --> 00:22:13.210
I'll leave first.

00:22:51.070 --> 00:22:53.790
Report! General Huo. Miss Cheng.

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:55.270
His Majesty requests that you return to the palace immediately.

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:56.430
Empress Xuan...

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:58.740
Empress Xuan doesn't have much longer to live!

00:23:58.810 --> 00:24:03.570
Shen'an, is there anything that

00:24:03.570 --> 00:24:05.560
weighs on your heart?

00:24:06.140 --> 00:24:09.730
Tell me, and I'll...

00:24:10.790 --> 00:24:13.330
would definitely make it happen for you.

00:24:22.650 --> 00:24:25.340
In my life,

00:24:25.340 --> 00:24:28.240
I have always lived for others.

00:24:28.240 --> 00:24:32.510
If I still spoke for others now

00:24:32.510 --> 00:24:35.530
it would be too meaningless.

00:24:38.460 --> 00:24:43.660
I have been at Your Majesty's side for several decades.

00:24:43.660 --> 00:24:46.610
I know that Your Majesty's interests

00:24:46.610 --> 00:24:50.750
are agriculture and academic research.

00:24:50.750 --> 00:24:54.140
An upright and sincere young man.

00:24:54.140 --> 00:24:56.830
If it were not for the disorder in the country

00:24:56.830 --> 00:24:59.780
and the tyranny of Emperor Li,

00:24:59.780 --> 00:25:04.890
Your Majesty would have liked to live peacefully in the countryside,

00:25:04.890 --> 00:25:09.360
marry Sister Yue Heng,

00:25:09.360 --> 00:25:11.650
have a few children,

00:25:11.650 --> 00:25:16.620
get up at dawn to work until evening

00:25:16.620 --> 00:25:20.440
and live a simple and peaceful life.

00:25:23.790 --> 00:25:25.640
Shen'an,

00:25:28.060 --> 00:25:30.560
of your whole life,

00:25:32.530 --> 00:25:34.250
I am the one who...

00:25:36.470 --> 00:25:38.520
who stood in your way.

00:25:38.520 --> 00:25:43.660
Your Majesty, you owe me nothing.

00:25:43.660 --> 00:25:47.120
I did not dare to challenge the marriage alliance made by my uncle.

00:25:47.120 --> 00:25:49.410
Meet you...

00:25:50.190 --> 00:25:56.280
was the chance of a lifetime.

00:26:13.760 --> 00:26:15.840
Your Majesty...

00:26:16.580 --> 00:26:21.630
has sacrificed too much for world peace.

00:26:21.630 --> 00:26:25.120
It's the same for Sister A'Heng.

00:26:25.120 --> 00:26:29.000
Under the pretext that she is courageous, direct

00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:31.280
and that she speaks openly,

00:26:31.280 --> 00:26:33.860
Your Majesty should not

00:26:33.860 --> 00:26:37.030
not to think that she did not take this to heart

00:26:37.030 --> 00:26:40.470
or that she didn't get her heart broken.

00:26:40.470 --> 00:26:45.310
I know she probably cried more in secret.

00:26:45.310 --> 00:26:49.190
than I did.

00:26:54.310 --> 00:26:57.300
In the future,

00:26:57.300 --> 00:27:01.790
Your Majesty and Sister A'Heng

00:27:01.790 --> 00:27:03.980
must be good to each other,

00:27:04.460 --> 00:27:11.370
just as you were close in the countryside,

00:27:12.520 --> 00:27:18.890
as if I had never been there.

00:27:26.580 --> 00:27:28.760
Older sister.

00:27:30.910 --> 00:27:32.440
Your Majesty.

00:27:32.440 --> 00:27:34.050
Yes ?

00:27:34.050 --> 00:27:39.400
Let me talk to A'Heng.

00:27:40.090 --> 00:27:41.570
All right.

00:27:55.610 --> 00:27:57.500
Older sister.

00:27:59.270 --> 00:28:02.370
As long as I, Yue Heng, am alive,

00:28:04.510 --> 00:28:07.680
I will make sure the Xuan family is safe and sound.

00:28:09.530 --> 00:28:12.250
Who is counting on you?

00:28:12.780 --> 00:28:15.770
There is the crown prince.

00:28:15.770 --> 00:28:18.790
He is calm and competent.

00:28:18.790 --> 00:28:21.950
I have no worries.

00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:30.380
Now I want to tell you about us.

00:28:33.620 --> 00:28:37.560
That year, when my son faced an assassination attempt at nineteen,

00:28:38.470 --> 00:28:42.100
I never doubted you.

00:28:43.450 --> 00:28:45.300
I know.

00:28:46.710 --> 00:28:48.660
That year,

00:28:49.730 --> 00:28:52.450
My son died prematurely at four months old,

00:28:53.170 --> 00:28:56.030
I never doubted you either.

00:28:56.030 --> 00:28:58.470
I know that...

00:28:58.470 --> 00:29:01.830
You never doubted me.

00:29:02.640 --> 00:29:07.070
That's why you weren't afraid of gossip.

00:29:07.070 --> 00:29:11.180
and accepted these children.

00:29:22.930 --> 00:29:24.820
Older sister.

00:29:25.980 --> 00:29:28.010
In my opinion,

00:29:30.230 --> 00:29:34.660
we are like real sisters.

00:29:35.270 --> 00:29:37.740
If we were

00:29:37.740 --> 00:29:42.530
sisters in an ordinary family,

00:29:42.530 --> 00:29:44.870
Wouldn't that be nice?

00:29:54.400 --> 00:29:59.330
Let the children come now.

00:30:02.830 --> 00:30:04.920
You can all come.

00:30:14.820 --> 00:30:17.690
Slowly, slowly.

00:30:30.230 --> 00:30:32.670
My body...

00:30:33.440 --> 00:30:36.780
will be buried in the Imperial Mausoleum.

00:30:37.690 --> 00:30:40.930
Will you allow me...

00:30:40.930 --> 00:30:43.840
to cut a small lock of hair

00:30:43.840 --> 00:30:47.390
for Shaoshang to make ashes of it

00:30:47.390 --> 00:30:50.990
to wear in the mountains

00:30:50.990 --> 00:30:54.590
where I lived during my childhood with my father?

00:30:58.300 --> 00:31:04.570
Whatever you say, we will do it.

00:31:08.840 --> 00:31:10.790
Son,

00:31:12.800 --> 00:31:16.510
don't always be so indecisive.

00:31:16.510 --> 00:31:20.010
No matter the fame.

00:31:20.010 --> 00:31:23.370
People must live with an open mind

00:31:23.370 --> 00:31:27.260
to be able to live a long time.

00:31:27.260 --> 00:31:33.230
I will let you take care of Lady-in-waiting Zhai in her old age.

00:31:33.230 --> 00:31:37.280
I would definitely take good care of Lady Companion Zhai.

00:31:37.280 --> 00:31:43.050
Imperial Mother, please hold on. I still want to serve you later in your old age.

00:31:43.050 --> 00:31:46.300
There is no later for me.

00:31:46.300 --> 00:31:49.650
Imperial Mother, I was wrong.

00:31:49.650 --> 00:31:51.450
I was wrong.

00:31:51.450 --> 00:31:55.060
I want to exchange my life for yours.

00:31:55.060 --> 00:31:58.390
If you are truly filial,

00:31:58.390 --> 00:32:02.030
don't use your life to trade it for mine.

00:32:02.030 --> 00:32:04.820
Live well.

00:32:04.820 --> 00:32:10.840
Cherish your own good times. Don't lose yourself.

00:32:14.850 --> 00:32:16.690
Zisheng.

00:32:24.450 --> 00:32:26.120
Empress.

00:32:29.250 --> 00:32:31.770
I disappointed you.

00:32:32.910 --> 00:32:36.850
I never held it against you.

00:32:36.850 --> 00:32:39.770
I know this has been hard for you

00:32:39.770 --> 00:32:43.180
all along this path.

00:32:43.180 --> 00:32:45.520
You don't owe us anything.

00:32:46.100 --> 00:32:52.450
I know you had regrets.

00:32:52.450 --> 00:32:55.210
When I'm gone,

00:32:55.210 --> 00:33:00.930
let the past scatter with the wind.

00:33:00.930 --> 00:33:05.590
You have to forgive yourself.

00:33:11.060 --> 00:33:13.380
Shaoshang,

00:33:14.040 --> 00:33:16.090
one.

00:33:24.050 --> 00:33:26.120
Shaoshang,

00:33:26.770 --> 00:33:29.670
I pulled you down

00:33:29.670 --> 00:33:33.090
for five years now.

00:33:33.090 --> 00:33:35.590
What do you mean, pulled down?

00:33:37.220 --> 00:33:40.130
I am always ready to follow the Empress...

00:33:40.780 --> 00:33:44.760
five more years, ten more years...

00:33:44.760 --> 00:33:47.040
Idiot.

00:33:47.040 --> 00:33:52.460
How many five years or ten years are there in a person's life?

00:33:52.460 --> 00:33:57.150
You've already lost a lot for my sake.

00:33:57.150 --> 00:34:02.300
I hope that in the coming days,

00:34:02.300 --> 00:34:06.310
you will live a good life for yourself.

00:34:07.380 --> 00:34:09.590
I don't want you to...

00:34:09.590 --> 00:34:13.700
waste the rest of your life like I did.

00:34:14.960 --> 00:34:21.240
As a mother, I hope you two

00:34:21.240 --> 00:34:23.930
will be able to take back your destined love.

00:34:24.660 --> 00:34:29.690
But as a sensitive elder,

00:34:29.690 --> 00:34:36.100
I also know that a marriage cannot be forced.

00:34:36.100 --> 00:34:38.810
I just want to rush you both

00:34:38.810 --> 00:34:43.080
to always follow your heart,

00:34:44.190 --> 00:34:49.580
to appreciate the present, and not regret it.

00:34:57.540 --> 00:35:00.070
In my next life,

00:35:01.260 --> 00:35:05.730
I hope I will live in a prosperous and peaceful era

00:35:05.730 --> 00:35:10.550
and that I will suffer less from homesickness and unrest.

00:35:10.550 --> 00:35:13.290
In my next life,

00:35:13.290 --> 00:35:17.370
I hope my parents live long and healthy lives...

00:35:18.120 --> 00:35:23.050
for fear that I have worry or sorrow.

00:35:23.050 --> 00:35:25.620
In my next life,

00:35:26.350 --> 00:35:30.100
I hope to be able to compose poetry in my youth

00:35:30.100 --> 00:35:33.670
and sing in the mountainous deserts.

00:35:37.380 --> 00:35:39.430
My husband,

00:35:41.110 --> 00:35:49.040
Marrying you was a stroke of luck in my life.

00:35:50.650 --> 00:35:56.590
But in the next life, I hope you and I...

00:35:57.580 --> 00:36:03.700
we won't... see each other... again.

00:40:01.770 --> 00:40:05.800
General Huo, let's go talk somewhere else.

00:40:08.640 --> 00:40:10.210
GOOD.

00:40:26.950 --> 00:40:29.380
What exactly happened?

00:40:33.210 --> 00:40:35.430
Empress Xuan has passed away.

00:40:39.430 --> 00:40:41.100
You can both rest assured.

00:40:41.100 --> 00:40:43.700
I only came to take Shaoshang home.

00:40:43.700 --> 00:40:47.150
I will leave immediately and not disturb you.

00:40:47.150 --> 00:40:49.200
Huo Buyi, stop right there!

00:40:52.190 --> 00:40:56.830
General Huo, what do you think the Marquis of Quling's Residence is?

00:40:56.830 --> 00:40:59.070
Who do you think our Niao Niao is?

00:40:59.070 --> 00:41:02.060
Can you come whenever you want and leave whenever you want?

00:41:03.680 --> 00:41:08.220
Just like years ago when you were about to marry her, but you abandoned her.

00:41:08.220 --> 00:41:11.300
Five years ago, you abandoned Niao Niao.

00:41:11.300 --> 00:41:14.590
She was so sick that she almost died.

00:41:14.590 --> 00:41:17.070
Go to the warehouse in the backyard to take a look.

00:41:17.070 --> 00:41:21.230
The half-built coffin for her is still there!

00:41:26.330 --> 00:41:28.470
I know I have deeply disappointed Shaoshang.

00:41:28.470 --> 00:41:32.110
I also know how much you love and care for Shaoshang.

00:41:32.110 --> 00:41:33.870
That's why...

00:41:35.690 --> 00:41:38.060
I have decided never to bother you again.

00:41:42.460 --> 00:41:46.970
Do you know how Niao Niao has lived these past five years?

00:41:47.620 --> 00:41:50.490
She loved the excitement and excitement more than anything.

00:41:50.490 --> 00:41:54.290
But she cloistered herself in Changqiu Palace for those entire five years.

00:41:57.000 --> 00:41:59.760
I was in pain and couldn't get better.

00:41:59.760 --> 00:42:04.380
His older brother got married. His older cousin started a family.

00:42:05.290 --> 00:42:08.650
We were all looking forward to seeing her again for that.

00:42:09.900 --> 00:42:13.370
But she never set foot outside Changqiu Palace.

00:42:14.010 --> 00:42:16.160
You lost her for five years.

00:42:16.160 --> 00:42:19.780
Our Cheng family also lost our daughter for five years!

00:42:23.330 --> 00:42:28.660
Do you know who she did this for?

00:42:30.410 --> 00:42:32.400
For you,

00:42:33.190 --> 00:42:35.360
Huo Buyi.

00:42:43.120 --> 00:42:45.190
It's all my fault.

00:42:45.800 --> 00:42:49.700
I abandoned Shaoshang despite all the love she had for me.

00:42:50.390 --> 00:42:53.450
I abandoned the Cheng family despite your trust in me.

00:43:01.620 --> 00:43:03.950
I'm sorry to Shaoshang.

00:43:03.950 --> 00:43:06.430
I also apologize to the Cheng family.

00:43:06.430 --> 00:43:11.960
What I owe you cannot be paid in my entire life.

00:43:11.960 --> 00:43:14.890
Not to mention the fact that Shaoshang can't forgive me,

00:43:17.440 --> 00:43:19.820
even me...

00:43:21.370 --> 00:43:24.600
I will never be able to forgive myself.

00:43:24.600 --> 00:43:26.720
In the Northwest,

00:43:27.820 --> 00:43:30.730
I fought and killed without caring whether it was day or night.

00:43:31.970 --> 00:43:35.900
I only wished that the blade of a sword would pierce my chest and leave me to die on the battlefield.

00:43:37.900 --> 00:43:40.670
But I didn't dare to die either.

00:43:43.260 --> 00:43:46.440
I haven't yet managed to make him forget his hateful resentment.

00:43:50.760 --> 00:43:54.190
I have no right to die.

00:43:55.690 --> 00:43:57.460
General Huo,

00:43:59.010 --> 00:44:01.230
We are not asking you to admit your guilt.

00:44:01.230 --> 00:44:05.990
What we just said was not to make you feel guilty.

00:44:05.990 --> 00:44:08.440
As Niao Niao's parents,

00:44:08.440 --> 00:44:12.080
We haven't given her enough love and care since she was young.

00:44:12.080 --> 00:44:14.770
It is also too late for us to regret it.

00:44:14.770 --> 00:44:20.060
In the future, no matter which road Niao Niao takes, and who she marries,

00:44:20.740 --> 00:44:25.340
We will let her decide from now on.

00:44:25.340 --> 00:44:29.870
Between you, one has love, the other has heart.

00:44:31.200 --> 00:44:33.970
What a pity that Heaven is playing tricks on us.

00:44:39.560 --> 00:44:42.980
As for whether you can get your previous condition back,

00:44:42.980 --> 00:44:47.470
take it step by step and wait and see.

00:44:57.310 --> 00:45:05.250
